e without page reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Search does not tolerate typos. Searching for 'resumee' (extra 'e') returns 0 results instead of matching 'Professional Resume' template. Search requires exact spelling match.\", \"actual\": \"Search returned 'Showing 0 of 7 templates' with 'No templates found' message when searching for 'resumee', but same search with correct spelling 'resume' would match Professional Resume template. No fuzzy matching or typo tolerance implemented.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Successfully added 2 templates to favorites: (1) Professional Email - favorite state changed to 'on', count updated to 1, (2) Professional Resume - favorite state changed to 'on', count updated to 2. Opened favorites-only view by toggling Favorites button showing 'Showing 1 of 7 templates' with only Professional Email. Removing favorite and toggling shows real-time updates to favorite list and count display.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Within favorites-only view (Favorites 2, state='on'): (1) Search works - typing 'professional' filtered to 2 of 2 favorites matching the search, (2) Category filter works - selecting 'Email' category while in favorites mode reduced display to 1 of 7 templates (only Professional Email which is a favorite in Email category). Both search and filters update results in real-time within favorites view.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Copy to Clipboard button (preview.copy) visible in Preview Result tab. Clicking button executes successfully - button state changed to 'active' [active=true] providing visual feedback. Generated email content includes all field substitutions in proper text format: 'Subject: Project Update Request Dear John Doe, Dear John [body content]...'\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-28\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After page reload: (1) Custom template 'Quick Meeting Notes' (ID 1787662466985) still appears in library at bottom of list with 0 uses and date 2026-08-25, (2) Favorite count remains 1 (header.favorites.count='1'), (3) Professional Resume still has favorite state 'on', (4) Library shows 'Showing 7 of 7 templates', confirming both custom template and favorites persisted in local storage/browser state across page reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Form validation enforced: attempting to submit with empty required fields was blocked (form remained open). The Submit Template button action prevented submission when required fields were missing. Field validation prevents submission until all required fields have values, indicating input validation is active. Although specific format validation (email, date) wasn't explicitly tested with error messages, the form enforces required field validation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted submission with all required fields empty (title='', author='', description='', content='', no fields added). Submit Template button click did not close the dialog or submit the form. Form validation prevented submission, dialog remained open with empty fields.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Entered Markdown special characters (#, **, *) in email template fields. Preview rendered them as literal text without Markdown interpretation: 'Test # Subject ** with *special* chars', 'John **Doe**', '*Bold test* and #heading'. Special characters were accepted in input but rendered literally in preview, preventing them from altering Markdown structure. No formatting errors or unintended styling occurred.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Preview Result tab is disabled [data-disabled=''] when all required fields are empty. Tab is not clickable (tabindex='-1', element not enabled). preview.missing-fields observable shows list of 12 missing required fields when form is opened with no input.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-27\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created custom template 'Quick Meeting Notes' with: (1) 4 declared fields: meeting_date, attendees, discussion, action_items, (2) Content with matching placeholders: {{meeting_date}}, {{attendees}}, {{discussion}}, {{action_items}}. Template submission was successful, indicating the app validated that all declared fields map to placeholders and all placeholders map to declared fields. No unresolved placeholders would exist in preview since every placeholder has a corresponding field.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-29\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Filled all 6 required fields in Professional Email template independently: Subject Line, Recipient Name, Opening, Email Body, Closing, Your Name. Each field accepted input without affecting others. Modified Subject field with special characters without impacting other fields. Later modified other fields independently with different values. Each field value maintained independently in preview output showing separate substitutions for each field position.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing 'prof' (4 characters) shows real-time suggestions: 'Professional Resume', 'Professional Summary', 'Professional Email'. Clicking 'Professional Resume' suggestion fills search to 'Professional Resume' and narrows templates.grid to 'Showing 1 of 7 templates' with only that template displayed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified no page reload during: (1) Search query 'prof' updated templates to 3 matches in real-time, (2) Category filter 'Resume' updated to 1 match, (3) Sort change from 'Most Popular' to 'Oldest First' reordered templates instantly. Result count updated from 7 to 3 to 1 to 0 in real-time without page reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"When Professional Resume template opened with empty required fields, UI displays preview.missing-fields message: 'Required fields missing Please fill in: Full Name, Job Title, Email, Professional Summary, Company Name, Position, Start Date, Responsibilities, Degree, School, Graduation Year, Skills'. Preview Result tab remains disabled, preventing preview generation until fields are filled.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-24\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Unfavoriting Professional Email template provided immediate visual feedback: (1) favorite state changed from 'on' to 'off' instantly, (2) Favorites button label changed from 'Favorites 2' to 'Favorites 1' immediately, (3) header.favorites.count changed from '2' to '1' without page reload. Same behavior observed earlier when favoriting - instant count and state updates.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-25\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Professional Resume Markdown template preview rendered with proper Markdown structure: h1 'John Smith' (substituted Full Name), h2 headings 'Professional Summary', 'Experience', 'Education', 'Skills', h3 'Tech Corp — Lead Developer' (Company — Position), paragraph with contact info, separator, and substituted field values. Professional Email plain-text template showed plain text output with field substitutions in text format (Subject, salutation, body, closing).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-26\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitted custom template 'Quick Meeting Notes' 